[00:14.292]吉他：朋克小地雷
[00:17.015]鼓：Dante Shen
[00:19.462]混音：Wenkai Huang
[00:24.674]Tell me that you've gone on a journey
[00:31.575]To a place where you are never lonely
[00:35.775]The skies are warm and clean as you said in the lucid dream
[00:46.110]Breathe in, the embers of the world around you lingering
[00:54.519]I see soft blooming flowers wither up, fly away and then again come back to me
[01:05.807]You told me there's a hero
[01:09.227]Who runs deep in my veins
[01:11.695]Don't fear being alone
[01:14.375]You're always here to stay
[01:16.975]You said live on through darkness
[01:19.639]And nothing lasts the same
[01:22.079]But love will never fade
[01:28.143]When I see you
[01:33.159]When I see you
[01:38.423]When I see you again
[02:10.162]You told me there's a hero
[02:13.586]Who runs deep in my veins
[02:16.306]Don't fear being alone
