[02:26.482]But love will never fade
[02:32.450]When I see you
[02:37.610]When I see you
[02:42.810]When I see you again
[02:52.230]Look into your eyes, suddenly I feel
[02:57.310]The moonlight is bleeding from your soul
[03:02.282]Close our eyes and sing about
[03:04.842]Search the sky for a while
[03:07.314]Maybe this time I'm brave to go with you
[03:12.706]We're on the way to face all of ourselves
[03:17.895]A gust softly flattens scars and smiles
[03:22.774]Before we all run from the horizon
[03:26.678]I'll hold you and never break hold
